    "detailed_description": "<h1>X-WAR COMMUNITY</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>WIN TO EARN \u2014 A Bet-Based Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the key features is the <strong>WIN TO EARN</strong> mode. Before a match, players from both teams place bets using in-game currency, forming a shared prize pool. The winning team takes it all\u2014the losers walk away with nothing. Maximum intensity, zero compromises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014740/extras/7d525ebcecbcbb0a99d353e2fe6400a4.avif?t=1748168447\" width=600 height=253 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc65 <strong>CLANS, COMPETITIONS, &amp; GLOBAL TOURNAMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with other players, form alliances, and dominate in clan wars. Tournaments with big rewards, leaderboards, and an anti-cheat system ensure fair and intense battles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>WEAPON &amp; CHARACTER CUSTOMIZATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock over <strong>25 weapon types</strong> and upgrade them with <strong>200+ mods</strong>\u2014scopes, attachments, and other enhancements. Customize your fighter\u2019s appearance: gear and accessories will help you stand out on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014740/extras/f46c29358929d34ff2ce0a84cadd6a6f.poster.avif?t=1748168447\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014740/extras/f46c29358929d34ff2ce0a84cadd6a6f.webm?t=1748168447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014740/extras/f46c29358929d34ff2ce0a84cadd6a6f.mp4?t=1748168447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>ECONOMY &amp; PROGRESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn in-game currency by completing daily missions. Invest in top-tier gear, join clans, and compete in tournaments with massive prize pools.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf03 <strong>REFERRAL SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite friends using your personal promo code and earn rewards like boosts, tokens, and gear. The more people you invite, the bigger the prizes!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>WIN TO EARN \u2014 A Bet-Based Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the key features is the <strong>WIN TO EARN</strong> mode. Before a match, players from both teams place bets using in-game currency, forming a shared prize pool. The winning team takes it all\u2014the losers walk away with nothing. Maximum intensity, zero compromises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014740/extras/7d525ebcecbcbb0a99d353e2fe6400a4.avif?t=1748168447\" width=600 height=253 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc65 <strong>CLANS, COMPETITIONS, &amp; GLOBAL TOURNAMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with other players, form alliances, and dominate in clan wars. Tournaments with big rewards, leaderboards, and an anti-cheat system ensure fair and intense battles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>WEAPON &amp; CHARACTER CUSTOMIZATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock over <strong>25 weapon types</strong> and upgrade them with <strong>200+ mods</strong>\u2014scopes, attachments, and other enhancements. Customize your fighter\u2019s appearance: gear and accessories will help you stand out on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014740/extras/f46c29358929d34ff2ce0a84cadd6a6f.poster.avif?t=1748168447\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014740/extras/f46c29358929d34ff2ce0a84cadd6a6f.webm?t=1748168447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014740/extras/f46c29358929d34ff2ce0a84cadd6a6f.mp4?t=1748168447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>ECONOMY &amp; PROGRESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn in-game currency by completing daily missions. Invest in top-tier gear, join clans, and compete in tournaments with massive prize pools.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf03 <strong>REFERRAL SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite friends using your personal promo code and earn rewards like boosts, tokens, and gear. The more people you invite, the bigger the prizes!</p>",
    "short_description": "X-WAR is a team-based shooter with a unique token betting mechanic. Gather your squad, place your bets before the match, and battle for the enemy's pot. Winners take all, losers walk away with nothing.",
